      "description": "A stereotype depicting a white, gun-owning, right-wing American patriot who is overly nationalistic, often associated with anti-government, anti-immigrant, and anti-leftist views. This stereotype is frequently used in media and memes to caricature certain political groups, especially those associated with the Second Amendment and conservative politics. The image of a man with a rifle in front of an American flag is a common visual shorthand for this stereotype.",
