      "description": "A form of patriotism that is extreme, aggressive, and often used to justify violence, discrimination, or intolerance. It is characterized by an exaggerated sense of national pride and a willingness to use inflammatory language or violent imagery to promote a particular political agenda. The meme uses the image of a man holding a rifle in front of an American flag to portray a caricature of toxic patriotism, which is often associated with right-wing extremism.",
